<section class="page-hero"><span class="pub-kicker">Switching to StockChief</span><h1>No blind import.<br>No surprise cutover.</h1><p>StockChief stages records, shows what it understood, blocks genuine ambiguity and reconciles totals before imported data becomes operational truth.</p></section>
<section class="migration-path"><article><span>01</span><div><small>BRING A SOURCE</small><h2>Start with files or a supported system</h2><p>CSV, XLSX and pasted data are the production fast path. Connections can follow after the first inventory is understandable.</p></div><b>Nothing committed</b></article><article><span>02</span><div><small>PREVIEW</small><h2>See products, variants, locations and quantities</h2><p>Mappings and interpretations are presented before they can change balances.</p></div><b>Reviewable</b></article><article><span>03</span><div><small>CLARIFY</small><h2>Stop where the source is genuinely ambiguous</h2><p>Unknown locations, competing product matches and unsafe assumptions require an answer.</p></div><b>Ask, never guess</b></article><article><span>04</span><div><small>RECONCILE</small><h2>Compare source and StockChief totals</h2><p>Counts and quantities are checked explicitly; duplicates and repeated imports are identified.</p></div><b>Totals explained</b></article><article><span>05</span><div><small>APPROVE</small><h2>Commit atomically—or not at all</h2><p>A failed import cannot leave half-created inventory truth. Approved imported records retain their source evidence.</p></div><b>Controlled cutover</b></article><article><span>06</span><div><small>OPERATE</small><h2>Set authority after the data is real</h2><p>StockChief proposes practical operating boundaries from the connected business state.</p></div><b>You choose</b></article></section>
<section class="migration-boundary"><div><span class="pub-kicker pub-kicker--light">Current boundary</span><h2>Inventory migration is ready. Full-business migration is a planned engagement.</h2></div><div><p><b>Production-capable today</b><span>Products, variants, locations, quantities, preview, duplicate protection, atomic execution, reconciliation and rollback.</span></p><p><b>Requires planned implementation</b><span>Generic cutover of every supplier, customer, open PO, Sales Order, historical document and custom source contract.</span></p></div></section>
<section class="pub-final"><span class="pub-kicker">Bring the records first</span><h2>Your first inventory is created automatically.</h2><p>After activation, choose files, connect another system, enter records manually, or skip and explore the usable empty application.</p><div class="pub-actions pub-actions--center"><a class="pub-btn" href="/register">Create account</a><a class="pub-btn pub-btn--secondary" href="/contact">Plan a complex migration</a></div></section>
